{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33186","headline":"晓过伊水寄龙门僧 · 司马扎","name":"晓过伊水寄龙门僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙门树色暗苍苍，伊水东流客恨长。\n病马独嘶残夜月，行人欲渡满船霜。\n几家烟火依村步，何处渔歌似故乡？\n山下禅庵老师在，愿将形役问空王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}